{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1538,
  "batch_count": 1662,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "c0513553da490a692523f45b5f779f99f6cb7e34",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a303371f137fd18ee5b5f382",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下雪天……我不太喜欢……\n因为比赛可能会因此中止……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a62685f89ac56537832444a0e7849155da9a917ce4df3e4225412457bc299a01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:535b8116fb0b10c4b9801913",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『闪耀月刊』的记者小姐\n来了操场……是来取材的吗？\n……身体都有点紧绷了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91f9bc29fa49b4bf8c497b78a492d11ea819a29f0bf9056d5a2c3069453fc8ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9671a2492b25535749d167c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "根据我的训练用时预测比赛……\n一定会有这样的人吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2815d13f1fe8b9f1e1f33af7213e94fb55b9b4a5fab545c029b6a1e51bf0fcc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4dab3c3cb7e3bee11b225a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员也有……自己的方略吗？\n有的话……还请务必教授给我……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0038e2e5c7f88f61ff32b28fe60f08cf88f58a36edec59dc59f8b3a61ad5bf6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fea836fbef80d2a1a6e6341e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "营养补给用的点心，\n我总是会多准备些……\n毕竟同期的伙伴们反响都很不错呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e227002375bc7f0a4610c5b74cce0cb2a572a0448f6ed8035cf5cf88e7d1c9ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c3286d89efc0de913e624e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个，训练员要一起……\n做做拉伸吗？\n为了确保我们都不会受伤。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66e6dabc3105c5e21df734c37b9b588394237295c85190158092b28cb647468a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33e700951dfaaaeb4d85ef28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了将来，我和训练员都能……\n作为『名留历史的黄金组合』\n被人传颂……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc5fe167a6fc59bfcf3155db6d18e60c6f2a70fd35b6bcb84ef7aa8a938d631d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fba77e62761ce080dffaba9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和训练员一起的话，\n一定能创造出……光辉的历史。\n……对此我很确信。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95262237d1f8f5d6d0f17705cbe1bb34e6496e742b9060ec75c6c0f934c54e7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb095938542facac5cb57e51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有句话叫『夏训升华赛马娘』……\n这段时期很重要。\n那个……请严格训练我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a110213dfb89fc0869c428014c95094a80028629fe808054498bc80f21524b49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59f64452c7c255dd159a47c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你和我创造的历史……\n有一种梦幻般的感觉呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "27d88f0f388bc1aff2ba22abda499709f01873591285dc322a565cd702a66c4e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60158a493c8570d4254d8afd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今后也，一起去刻下新的历史吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b42fc950f7c5066a40bf197a063792c10ea3ad6f3fc771d54d1c3f3e01c2bbec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77d724aae0017059614b4dbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又刻下了新的历史。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88fbf9c04b6a8fbc16f07ddd767df13d1a4b6bd5f25d579d5aaa7abfc527d1b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da21d95538f7cf684fc46acf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个……\n说不定是史上第一呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89a784056ae9cfe17f67ddac6b8bbdec71c4ce2be49bb90a7659ff150f83615f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a9cf0664d61436f966dae57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是创世驹。\n我、我要创造历史……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d49cf2edc5721aadbc51a6d6d505d1f1dd43bb019d7d5bf0fca10ba64241bc8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12e06b795d642790f5374a73",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用我的足迹！\n来创造历史！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0ce2a9944e6211c6d5b0715fec2212fd32dc14dee614396dd50c09a89173905",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a7b0eb2cf17e2b96ddcb422",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的预测是……这样……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a44f68205d3f1dfbf0813c467dcd54ea9c55ab792509346787a9d08f1f5a29c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:145391a7bb99e34fe73f276c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "方略更新……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "319689938a566879c96db9403870b7954510ddfc53e26ca393cc97d151c22cf6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1133",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:883ac0892c1002fb91656d89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "与大家一同——",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1ef149c3a519c99453ca882f231990b92d01de81aa685c1aeebb81063c70111",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25e1637a8847638bf5a1c539",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使现在还不成熟——总有一天，\n我会献上黄金的花束。献给你温柔的\n祝福——我，一定会送达。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7958b1b5a5458e48bb0e07e4ec7a487872be727e6e35d67d697a837e41f90363",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:106028fad45f7bceddb21e5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:197b03e32b27d62543317cfb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9fe3320c4d6d294c2b689a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想为了你而取胜。\n为了你——我相信自己无论到哪里，\n都能变得更强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3707495a6462b5bc8ac605cf7a2be9f2e0ab6b1353d74d2d131032ee1dc0d08c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6f4294cb9efa2dcc0d2e343",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果可以的话…要不要两个人一起\n培育芍药？慢慢等待——让它与\n梦想一同——美丽绽放。",
      "source_fingerprint": "153a123306918f588d507df49aee7fee45e0d317edcbd562c9068d0887ade2da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83885aa2c90dd879f77d4839",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为是正月——我和草上飞同学\n挑战了门松花艺。\n和风的调和也——别有韵味呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15387ce947dc4907b25eb1f41e0f9ccde9c7ee4af7d580bf6ccdbd77166fc859",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04a4a11afdda4b54a1050893",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我正和紫丁同学一起，给关照过我们的人\n送去巧克力小花束。\n如果可以的话，请你也收下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8897b429d21fae2d2e958af0e38523ce36007207210651f126c8ab53968f16e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97172847e12ad50710de30be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "肚子有些饿了吗…？\n那个…我在想，要不要吃点巧克力。\n如果你不讨厌——手工的话…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df21f58567e89171c1dc139b6b188bfddca3cbb10baf709f78345604d0431d78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfe145e806c074314bf044e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "七夕的竹枝，是和大家一起完成的\n花艺作品。呵呵，今年会\n做成怎样的效果呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a5fa0f5082079061f1a2e652b4c547738822bb13b2c4a4caedc275916a17c4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f682d42e8212f6f2caf38272",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "万圣节那天——我曾在父亲的医院里\n分发亲手做的卡片。\n大家的笑容，我至今仍记得。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4491b93838a02f1417f36019ff80e964ff970101f9d82167d8e54bcbee41e322",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fc91c9795738ee3cc03482f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "整座城市染上灯饰，\n调和成满满的圣诞色彩——\n让人每天都想出门散步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "768778f1abc0eb8e57b0ce710b00f133e6e1d3cceaae225c1db64e0ff41697e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9a2fa21f4e22cabcb24d63f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说花环能辟邪，也能祈愿幸福。\n如果…你感兴趣的话，\n我们也——试着做一个吧…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2891b8fb8f6439aa1058cafb59064b98a49398c860ec3fb7e869f5d07f249df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64eb9bbf08faaf16a881f032",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "努力开花结果了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2a47ed2ce2227b53bf876d19cc00ced857261a9ac2755139609bdb094442fed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f28e0236f195326435049622",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "美浦宿舍的大扫除——杏目同学尤其\n干劲十足。她让我也产生了\n要努力的动力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "13760ef89f059752b8b2c81f8d148800650586c55f6e088c6cf4913cb266f72c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:993a2bb7e49f1bee4b5037bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天是你作为主角的日子呢。\n——愿这一天充满幸福的调和。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdc48056971a271da3cb86c678b6f1644ecdcb3bbada658bc5db2316bf59ad15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91f80bbcfb475e8385fdf1ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我做了一条手链。\n愿你能得到蓝色康乃馨的\n祝福——",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1eb2d2ed11818168a00cba69bcb8e0d55229a76b5414b7a37492c58c44fc1b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e71ba84eea961e26f4b4d88e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家送来的花束，\n让房间里飘满了花香——\n我和也文摄辉同学都很幸福。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3668a65fb6ab12f0c10311d1c0913e5bf189f4fd4c61bb1a3a6ae0c6f16eebf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:824a0ee6c63f2f38cd6b0b94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…！那束花，是送给我的吗？——啊啊\n…多么美丽，又多么温暖。你的\n心意…无比清晰地传达给我了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87698bb1accfd294679351de7746fd7c562c0dc2daa29f2851467001d2b6aed3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6833d070920363488a22e670",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有通知送到了。\n——我先放在这里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2970841fbfa8dc51b3aab10913d5dd8f9e6ab57d1aa51a45d970352f8f7870f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6d393e6e6a4a6648ed83c34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "礼物——一定是\n你的温柔结出了果实，\n然后回到了你身边吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e20be424c8d779e8e646b3bc847c280ed3820a1f15e6af1ba48c6307f096f974",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5676b146834ba706a8a739b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务达成——\n日复一日的积累，作为成果\n显现出来了呢。真了不起。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38eb67985469aa738dc658883a0f446fef0df0f15a07fc63f6904d50623045cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d684eea1df94fcb0a77aea8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动马上就要开始了呢。\n准备时那种融为一体的感觉——\n我也相当喜欢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a23ab50586f23bea1b08d051485f2796c40ec0b39ece92d0aab4b30562d6d638",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1956e082ffdb556fa68d2f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是很棒的活动呢。\n为了让你能尽情享受——\n我也会尽力而为。",
      "source_fingerprint": "25757cf54a3e39e5a9f10617d52ff5337b967488f7d4cbce181806f747a1f313",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0448dc0d254943a8d691dbf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次一定要赢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cbdae13e6206df53953b92f20fc9e4244e36cf0399839223f989410b29524a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1abfba833b8c11c8a048932",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴等级——提升了呢。\n之后一起庆祝吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a3155808870cd2bd33d21bf310da9c3cededa00da5b45676626c4d58747992c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1b614c4aa86cb90ce073d6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢花纹衣服呢。——尤其是\n会考虑花的种类和色彩平衡\n来设计的服装，我很难抗拒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60a4152ff4cd21a2eb502f9b5656187924d30ba4d44f451b85939a4c6d5af246",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:198becb111e36a6fcc70c1bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前我常常——和真机伶一起\n去看衣服。一起寻找可爱的搭配\n…真怀念呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a0a4edb973cfa701dad8c9552f6050c51d61f501daed48305df72583cff56f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4134077449744f72513dfd20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "纵览整体，思考如何魅力地\n调和并束起——服装搭配\n也很有意思。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c358a84d2556ae31b2e9fabbbceb9e4aab483a61b542f05c13aa455140d3a2c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3b924b572001865ac16781d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是一场不错的对决呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33ae0f7c5c191ca2f5836aef48efbbe87c0ae5691c18ebbb47b413bdafdeec28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc991f70bb8d3ebe83571780",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是齐心协力的成果呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "393f2943f27b210dfe0493a3c95df1088d2dc74c2ae34b38c9328df2c4de72c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d14e949b374add23b73ab23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次一定要赢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cbdae13e6206df53953b92f20fc9e4244e36cf0399839223f989410b29524a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a81ed739e712094ce9a9ac5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是一场不错的对决呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33ae0f7c5c191ca2f5836aef48efbbe87c0ae5691c18ebbb47b413bdafdeec28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b2686c764be638d896bf74b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功刷新纪录了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "58418bd3df255677e9a8b3139f39e47a52b121323f8ef285415a10c889e2df12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a80b78a4ed5acb9fbf19768",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让波长合在一起——",
      "source_fingerprint": "cffaa31481a7ddc53ad6fcffac44000aaa75c260a674d41946c23cde6739d36f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c1ff78ce60e2550309805d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96ed845c4aab07d69465e2c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了让荣光之花盛开——\n唯有训练呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6275330967e97a88ef5ee5866fdef849e506b6bbb7ef2e8ad6ea3772da3654ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e22ca8e603796e4a445a02ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "相互竞争，相互调和——这种连续，\n会成为名为历史的光辉。\n非常——令人感慨。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e04fca6e7ad3cbc24fc4f68f07dd14b981aa995f8ff09694cc2b8f90d85c4e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e4a2ca4003b16fbde4323e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是参赛手续吗？\n我已经——做好觉悟了。\n随时请叫我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dde17d1c6b38a887f3571122fbd6b33e470175bd682a80dd75d527070eb4e607",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f63c4bba82ce73726cbc7e18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:912668e5d61ab398d201bc39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "调和起来——成为全新的我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "94fe3fac82147a7664f3462f8253c7f92915c611cd6aded0df910b5aa36d9b41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:641aeae38c2e809a6943f7ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "华丽地…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "71d4856319e1c748938ac1ebef60d65e077a45569ad0077d28b26ea8b104fff0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "1270"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c165a8c6a69637ebdb295d96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尽情绽放吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "551c5c6cecf9a66aa09f8240f9c313a316f06bf1b23b751f5230c1ec096630f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "1271"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:188c27924c98d9a0cad8f0e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的登录奖励是\n——这个。",
      "source_fingerprint": "68100451b8d9bda1833bf0e5e003f00473e8e1d304db42b8ad15095cc1302b40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e01dcb18fc9ecb4cb08794f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会——为你加油。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c6d63bfe5b6b1ccd97749d4c3d13b87977da790129eebdb9944d7e537b90540",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1718731ef4a237ffb290bb1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太棒了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4630ff91614a71d4231c39b2dc2eb6df3b988cde634293116a8f17e4371acdbc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e21a9ef468568dc2da931f18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "edde3a8d21b92c27a5c507c923669ab158c7e313c638cf35c7fcfc2b08ad7741",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8c8606a4a11de28f13d1169",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真的是——非常漂亮的手法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d101ea2791f9c96061f799fd23e66f5df67694c10b336cb6f71af1f3edca75c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "140003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9774936e0c184680a5fb0c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "连在旁边看的我也很开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "384ee887ae32d07ed9ca6efe0d4a9eed52cf8aee6b565535927c562b80a12d1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "140004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd965c2feabfa15367dacf50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次一定——",
      "source_fingerprint": "b61faeba57a3757d68f3adfae973cd04cefa04b3634b2bdf1236b37f2c6fb698",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "140005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8abdc4b17ca739c9266e4f4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真的是——非常漂亮的手法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d101ea2791f9c96061f799fd23e66f5df67694c10b336cb6f71af1f3edca75c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "140006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3ce44985bfb261710d163bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "连在旁边看的我也很开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "384ee887ae32d07ed9ca6efe0d4a9eed52cf8aee6b565535927c562b80a12d1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "140007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa2868c27791badd204e4cea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "——怎么了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5119dedfc09be228d30320508a9a170f025268de267dbb27655e5c199c415323",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "140008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e3d7740bb6c58dcbc58875a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "放松下来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb5b7d1b589781b79cab3f64a61d0cfc062b72296f311f826b6c06d1ecc3583d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "140009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24f6f3bc99f5e53dc21978b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我相信着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0c388d9892863d48052f48d06b989ed116eccb6417e7e214244523ed8ad3c3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "140010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6b8e5abdf15f016ba974abe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀——真厉害。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1d0121276cda86163d50d088c0ebace6cab48904e14f17af14185ba93b707ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "140011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d31e353b82348162382d40c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太棒了…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59cc707a8b560688f43a8918cdcf3087c8556a92126e6204071bc593d28b1532",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "140012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87086bb3d15e2028345db3b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就这样，慢慢地——",
      "source_fingerprint": "25f19433db4b20a0b75f199568b3d1378cbceccd6a7b678fdb176365ac834141",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cab735f79968ea984edb146c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还远远不够…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75585c95bed47deeea58186ce7990f40bbfb54bf899c689a00f7c810490b2134",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30b76550f886109acae0aa9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4e8d20aa5151334b4c38a65a505a9374b636972b6acc835853e25c1ff32890f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b28705daa7dabe5d18441bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要不要稍微歇一口气？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee33f8c66358afbdc475dec3359abdfe87bd15f1605024423e1d630fd574d286",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ba70fd770f4827ba8ba304f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可惜了…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe3661a132d6c1c70ddae03f94e11f02c972be5b387e934f53f5dddba55b8467",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ad605385eec8f02e0ef5076",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没事——的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1af9492c3e80c140ce70645ad668f3309f639700ae60f5edab40fcd302da4c49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1134",
        "140018"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
